     {
      "anchor": "sub-cutoff",
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "number": "2.3",
      "text": "Cut-off criteria",
      "toc": true
     },
     {
      "html": false,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "style": "body",
      "text": "Processes whose total contribution is less than 1% of the total mass and primary energy of the declared or functional unit may be excluded, provided that the total of excluded flows does not exceed 5% of mass and energy per module. No known flows were deliberately excluded."
     },
     {
      "anchor": "sub-allocation",
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "number": "2.4",
      "text": "Allocation",
      "toc": true
     },
     {
      "html": false,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "style": "body",
      "text": "Where a manufacturing site produces several products, energy, materials and wastes were allocated on a mass basis. Recycled content enters the system burden-free (cut-off approach); burdens of material recycling at end of life are attributed to the system that uses the secondary material."
     },
     {
      "anchor": "sub-dq",
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "number": "2.5",
      "text": "Data sources and data quality",
      "toc": true
     },
     {
      "html": false,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "style": "body",
      "text": "Primary data was collected from the manufacturer for the reference year. Background data was taken from the LCI database listed in the declaration summary, selected for technological, geographical and temporal representativeness."
     }
