     {
      "anchor": "sub-contribution",
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "number": "4.1",
      "text": "Contribution analysis",
      "toc": true
     },
     {
      "html": false,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "style": "body",
      "text": "The interpretation is based on TRACI 2.1 results."
     },
     {
      "html": false,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "style": "body",
      "text": "The product stage (A1–A3) accounts for 100.0% of global warming potential across the declared modules, excluding module D. Module A1–A3 — Product stage contributes 100.0% of total global warming potential. Module A1–A3 — Product stage contributes 100.0% of total ozone depletion potential. Module A1–A3 — Product stage contributes 100.0% of total acidification potential. Module A1–A3 — Product stage contributes 100.0% of total eutrophication potential. Module A1–A3 — Product stage contributes 100.0% of total smog formation potential."
     },
     {
      "anchor": "sub-charts",
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "number": "4.2",
      "text": "Results by life cycle module",
      "toc": true
     },
