      "toc": true
     },
     {
      "html": false,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "style": "body",
      "text": "Because module A1–A3 dominates the results (more than 80% of global warming potential), Figure 3 shows the relative contribution of the remaining modules with A1–A3 excluded."
